$ D-079 limitation: G4 capacity-conflict item role label (FE-F handback §4)
105:- **Some subjects are server data, shown as the server returns them.** Dependency codes (`DEP-nn`) and capacity-conflict role and period come from the single item's message, after the label. They are data, not label text. The role label there is the role's English `labelEn` from the server, so in AR a role's English name can appear as data. The fix would be a backend change (structured item data), which is out of scope.

